<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14070" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπο-τμήγω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποτέμνω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cut off from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοῦνον ἀποτμήξας πόλιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					22.456
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν . . λαοῦ ἀποτμήξαντε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					10.364
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>cut off, sever,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεῖρας ἀπὸ ξίφεϊ τμήξας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.146
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήδεα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					188
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλιτῦς τότ᾽ ἀποτμήγουσι χαράδραι</span>
			<i>plough</i> the hill-sides, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				16.390
			</span></i>:— 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοῦνοι ἀποτμηγέντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.1052
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ ἑνός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					34
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
